{"articleNo":"252200","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=252200&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2021-1 교육봉사활동 계획서 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.03.03","hit":"13049","attachments":[{"name":"교육봉사활동계획서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=252200&attachNo=96754"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:5.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\nmargin-left:15.9pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-15.9pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">2021</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">학년도<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 1</span>학기 교육봉사활동 수강신청자는 봉사활동 기관을 확인하여 기한 내 <b>교육봉사활동 계획서<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>붙임<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></b>를 반드시 제출하시기 바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:5.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\nmargin-left:15.9pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-15.9pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span style=\"font-size:\n12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">가<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>교육봉사활동\n인정 기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">「유아교육법」제<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>조에 따른 유치원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">「초·중등교육법」제<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>조에 따른 학교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">「재외국민 교육지원 등에\n관한 법률」제<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>조에 따른 한국학교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">「평생교육법」제<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>조제<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>항에 따른 학력인정 평생교육시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:5.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;\nmargin-left:32.6pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-32.6pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">-\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">우리대학과\n교류 협정을 체결한 외국의 대학 또는 교육청이 지정한 정규 유치원 및 초·중등학교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">공공기관이 인정한 비영리기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;line-height:135%\"><span style=\"font-size:\n12.0pt;line-height:135%;font-family:&quot;휴먼명조&quot;,serif\">나<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>교육봉사활동\n이수 절차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></